{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_007", "block_type": "title", "text": "自願公告 關於股價及成交量不尋常波動", "bbox": {"l": 191.2458, "t": 561.8856887695313, "r": 404.0457999999998, "b": 528.4714876726391, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/6", "source_label": "section_header", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/6", "source_order": 7, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_008", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "本公告由信達生物製藥 （ 「 本公司 」 ，連同其附屬公司統稱 「 本集團 」 ） 自願作出。", "bbox": {"l": 42.5197, "t": 504.45368876953125, "r": 536.3725000000004, "b": 492.595126678028, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/7", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/7", "source_order": 8, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_009", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "本公司關注到本公司股價和成交量近日發生不正常波動，特此澄清：本公司業務 運營⼀切正常，並未發生任何變化。經作出合理查詢後，董事會確認，截至本公 告日期，其並不知悉為避免本公司證券出現虛假市場而須予披露的任何資料，或 根據香港法例第 571 章證券及期貨條例第 XIVA 部須予披露的任何內幕消息。", "bbox": {"l": 42.5197, "t": 467.70368876953125, "r": 552.7846999999995, "b": 402.17377340204786, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/8", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/8", "source_order": 9, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_010", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "在第⼆個十年 「可持續發展和全球創新」 戰略目標指引下，本公司在過往不斷取得 了優異的成績，並實現了重要的里程碑。展望未來，本公司認為， 2025 年將是業 務快速成長和全球創新⼒再進⼀步的⼀年。", "bbox": {"l": 42.5197, "t": 377.69768876953117, "r": 552.7637000000001, "b": 330.58712667802786, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/9", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/9", "source_order": 10, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_011", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "信達生物已經成為腫瘤治療領域的領導品牌，並憑藉不斷擴大的協同產品組合不 斷獲得發展勢頭。此外，綜合產品線作為公司增長的第⼆生長極，憑藉其極具競 爭⼒的產品組合 （括瑪仕度肽 (GCG/GLP-1) 、替妥尤單抗 (IGF-1R) 及匹康奇拜單 抗 (IL-23p19) ） 將解鎖高潛慢病市場空間，而該等產品目前正由中國國家藥品監督 管理局審批中。", "bbox": {"l": 42.51969999999994, "t": 305.6956887695311, "r": 552.8826999999997, "b": 222.57712667802775, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/10", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/10", "source_order": 11, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_012", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "本公司對在 2027 年實現國內產品收入人民幣 200 億元目標的信心堅定。在保持業 務規模高速增長的同時，本公司精益運營，向可持續發展且健康的運營模式持續 提升。", "bbox": {"l": 42.51969999999994, "t": 197.685688769531, "r": 552.7846999999994, "b": 150.5751266780278, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/11", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/11", "source_order": 12, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 1, "section_id": "SEC001", "section_title": "信達生物製藥", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p1_013", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "同時，本公司新⼀代管線迎來全球發展新機會，逐步打開向上空間。以 IO 和 ADC 為代表的新⼀代創新管線陸續迎來全球開發新機會。未來，本公司將有更多創新 型 ADC 、雙 （多） 抗、下⼀代自免和心血管及代謝 （ CVM ） 療法逐步進入全球開發。", "bbox": {"l": 42.51969999999994, "t": 125.68368876953105, "r": 552.8225000000007, "b": 78.15777340204772, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/12", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/12", "source_order": 13, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
